     76  f008							; ==============================================================================
     77  f008							; HcrPush — cold growth push (user 2026-10-16): while the hcrunch prefix
     78  f008							; ADVANCES it shoves the player toward center, so a cold shutter cannot
     79  f008							; trap them inside (hot = kill semantics, unchanged). Called from
     80  f008							; PhHcrEntry on the 16f grow-step edge (EnemyRamP & $0F == 0) with the
     81  f008							; spent (b7) latch filtered; this body re-checks the phase (s4-12).
     82  f008							; In:	CollisionX = 8n (prefix width px), CollisionCellX = band (0-2),
     83  f008							;	Y = hot (full MetaB byte, bank2-staged; masked here). Out: RoomX
     84  f008							;	clamped out of the left prefix [0,8n) / the TIA mirror [160-8n,160);
     85  f008							;	A/X/Y + CollisionX clobbered.
     86  f008							; ==============================================================================
