    372  f80f							; PhVcrEntry — PhaseBlink $81 (vcrunch) tramp target.
    373  f80f							; Record: $81, x (4px col), y (row), w (4px), h (rows). The covered TOP
    374  f80f							; rows of the bbox keep/set their pair bits (shutter closed), the open
    375  f80f							; rows clear them (shutter retracted). covered_h = CrunchClock(h) —
    376  f80f							; ping-pong with a dwell at the home stub (always ≥1 row: never gone,
    377  f80f							; user ruling 2026-10-13). Y = record class on entry; tail leaves
    378  f80f							; Y = base+2 for PhNext. Clobbers A/X/Y + LineCount/CCX/CEY.
    379  f80f							; ==============================================================================
    380  f80f							; ==============================================================================
    381  f80f							; PhVcrEntry RETIRED (2026-10-19) — bank2's PhVcrPre tail-jmps VcrShutter
    382  f80f							; (bank2) since the Phase-B rework; no tramp targets $F800 anymore (the
    383  f80f							; $FB57/$FE67 images are legacy fill). The whole $F800-$F87F block is free
    384  f80f							; for data. Vcrunch's live path = bank2 VcrShutter (PF punch + Temp/BandTab)
    385  f80f							; + bank3 VCS3 (kill); CrunchClock/CrunchMasks/PhVcApply* remain for it.
